 array using the `add`, `remove`, `replace`, `move`, `copy`, and `test` operations. It returns a new
 JSON value and never mutates the source document. Both inputs must be JSON values; invalid patch
 documents and failed operations throw, leaving the source document unchanged.
+
+## JSON Merge Patch
+
+`applyMergePatch(target, patch)` applies an [RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7386)
+document. Object members whose patch value is `null` are removed; non-object values, including arrays,
+replace the target value. It returns a new JSON value and never mutates either input. Both arguments
+must be JSON values.
